    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<h2>Level 18 — <strong>Final Crescendo</strong></h2><p>You burn everything at once.</p><h3>Once per Soma Break</h3><p>As a bonus action:</p><ul><li><p>You immediately enter <strong>Burn 4</strong></p></li><li><p>For the rest of the turn:</p><ul><li><p>All attacks deal <strong>maximum damage</strong></p></li><li><p>You may cleave freely (no once-per-turn limit)</p></li></ul></li></ul><h3>Aftermath</h3><ul><li><p>Your Burn drops to <strong>0</strong></p></li><li><p>You suffer <strong>severe backlash</strong>:</p><ul><li><p>roll 3d10 keep lowest 2 on attacks and defense checks</p></li><li><p>Speed reduced to 0 until the end of your next turn</p></li><li><p>GM may impose a narrative consequence</p></li></ul></li></ul><p>The hymn always ends in silence.</p><hr /><h3></h3>",
      "chat": ""
    },
